(2254710, 310644, 37961, '<td valign="top">I came so close to doing this myself but my model cancelled at the last minute. I have the frame and black cloth attached sitting in my living room. <br/> <br/>I do like your choice of location, lots of visual interest in those woods, I do wonder why you chose to offset your frame to the left, rather than the right like elsapos. Your execution of the frame is good, your hands really arent in the most convincing postion though. Overall its not a bad representation, I tink I would have liked to have seen your head out of the portal a little more and the portal off to the right some. <br/> <br/>Either way, good attempt. It is a hard entry to mimick for sure.</td>', 'I came so close to doing this myself but my model cancelled at the last minute. I have the frame and black cloth attached sitting in my living room.  I do like your choice of location, lots of visual interest in those woods, I do wonder why you chose to offset your frame to the left, rather than the right like elsapos. Your execution of the frame is good, your hands really arent in the most convincing postion though. Overall its not a bad representation, I tink I would have liked to have seen your head out of the portal a little more and the portal off to the right some.  Either way, good attempt. It is a hard entry to mimick for sure.', '2006-03-24 11:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
