(2255699, 309800, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice.  It does have a very similar look to oskar''s ribbon winning entry - but yours is not as smooth and there''s no foreground in yours.  Overall, your image is rather more centered than oskar''s, which gives it a feeling of static that is somewhat different than the feel in oskar''s image.  Good work though.<br/> <br/>But you could have cloned out the dustbunnies :)</td>', 'Nice.  It does have a very similar look to oskar''s ribbon winning entry - but yours is not as smooth and there''s no foreground in yours.  Overall, your image is rather more centered than oskar''s, which gives it a feeling of static that is somewhat different than the feel in oskar''s image.  Good work though. But you could have cloned out the dustbunnies :)', '2006-03-24 16:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
