(2255730, 308138, 35739, '<td valign="top">I believe this looks better than the original however the original was done with basic editing.  I like your models pose alot better.  Excellant job.</td>', 'I believe this looks better than the original however the original was done with basic editing.  I like your models pose alot better.  Excellant job.', '2006-03-24 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255747, 308280, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!  I laughed out loud while sitting here are work.  Great shot!  Lighting, DOF and detail are spot on!  I love that you added your own touch to the image.  This image will also appeal to my son AND daughter. :-)  Great shot!</td>', 'This is hilarious!  I laughed out loud while sitting here are work.  Great shot!  Lighting, DOF and detail are spot on!  I love that you added your own touch to the image.  This image will also appeal to my son AND daughter. :-)  Great shot!', '2006-03-24 16:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255754, 309539, 40019, '<td valign="top">Oh no!  More dead glued ladybugs!  Great shot.  Nice rich colors, good set-up, great DOF.  Nicely done. Good luck.</td>', 'Oh no!  More dead glued ladybugs!  Great shot.  Nice rich colors, good set-up, great DOF.  Nicely done. Good luck.', '2006-03-24 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2255762, 309072, 40019, '<td valign="top">Classic!  I LOVE it!  Lighting and froggy set-up are perfect!  Did you have problems with the tape keeping up your lighting and background (like Nico did)?  I''ll only give you a 10 if you did.  :-)  Great shot!</td>', 'Classic!  I LOVE it!  Lighting and froggy set-up are perfect!  Did you have problems with the tape keeping up your lighting and background (like Nico did)?  I''ll only give you a 10 if you did.  :-)  Great shot!', '2006-03-24 16:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
