(2255780, 310618, 29269, '<td valign="top">I was just thinking to myself: is anyone going to try after the highest-ranked photo @DPC: and here we go!<br/> <br/>Great execution! The only negative is this hint of a frame, a discoloration near top and left edges.</td>', 'I was just thinking to myself: is anyone going to try after the highest-ranked photo @DPC: and here we go! Great execution! The only negative is this hint of a frame, a discoloration near top and left edges.', '2006-03-24 16:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
