(2265759, 310239, 27482, '<td valign="top">That shot didn´t ribbon so technically this doesn´t meet the challenge but I am not going to mark you down for that since that shot is one of my favorites.  Why didn´t you copy my shot instead :)  I would have given you a 10 straight away, hehe.  Anyway, this is pretty well done but what really sets the original apart from this is the backround, it´s just to sterile and boring in this shot but very interesting and flattering to the subject in Terjes shot.  Other than that, well done, especially on the technicals.  Gave this a 7.</td>', 'That shot didn´t ribbon so technically this doesn´t meet the challenge but I am not going to mark you down for that since that shot is one of my favorites.  Why didn´t you copy my shot instead :)  I would have given you a 10 straight away, hehe.  Anyway, this is pretty well done but what really sets the original apart from this is the backround, it´s just to sterile and boring in this shot but very interesting and flattering to the subject in Terjes shot.  Other than that, well done, especially on the technicals.  Gave this a 7.', '2006-03-28 07:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
