(2265789, 310644, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice but Elsapos shot had so much better lighting, a very mystical lighting that set the mood for his shot and that is not the case here, that and also the shallow DOF gave it a very mysterious and magical quality.  This is hardly bad though and a nice imitation, keep it up.</td>', 'Nice but Elsapos shot had so much better lighting, a very mystical lighting that set the mood for his shot and that is not the case here, that and also the shallow DOF gave it a very mysterious and magical quality.  This is hardly bad though and a nice imitation, keep it up.', '2006-03-28 07:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
