(2273990, 310345, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition... well setup, nice smoke, decent lighting. Since this is advanced editing you should have cloned out the sensor dust or whatever those watermark-like defects in the smoke are. The tiny bits of match that show right on the bottom to the left of the leftmost match is a distraction. I recommend correcting both if you chose to make a print of this very fine image.</td>', 'This is a great composition... well setup, nice smoke, decent lighting. Since this is advanced editing you should have cloned out the sensor dust or whatever those watermark-like defects in the smoke are. The tiny bits of match that show right on the bottom to the left of the leftmost match is a distraction. I recommend correcting both if you chose to make a print of this very fine image.', '2006-03-30 17:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273991, 309686, 5792, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is funny!!!! Sonifo is one of my favorite photographers at DPC and yours is a hilarious parity on her work. If I could stop laughing long enough I''d say more than just that I wish you had taken it with a bit more DOF so the good looking hairs on those legs showed up better. LOL!!!</td>', 'Now THAT is funny!!!! Sonifo is one of my favorite photographers at DPC and yours is a hilarious parity on her work. If I could stop laughing long enough I''d say more than just that I wish you had taken it with a bit more DOF so the good looking hairs on those legs showed up better. LOL!!!', '2006-03-30 17:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274003, 310628, 5792, '<td valign="top">Flowers, as still life pictures, have become cliche because they are done so often. But you''ve created an incredible composition with superb color and eye appealing balance. You humble my inferior attempts. One of the best images in this challenge.</td>', 'Flowers, as still life pictures, have become cliche because they are done so often. But you''ve created an incredible composition with superb color and eye appealing balance. You humble my inferior attempts. One of the best images in this challenge.', '2006-03-30 17:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274004, 309844, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-03-30 17:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274008, 310287, 5792, '<td valign="top">This composition is a superb study in color and light. You are to be commended for this terrific creation.</td>', 'This composition is a superb study in color and light. You are to be commended for this terrific creation.', '2006-03-30 17:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
