(2274026, 310071, 5792, '<td valign="top">I liked the original and I like this one. I gotta take that picture sometime myself. You did a good job giving it a surreal look.</td>', 'I liked the original and I like this one. I gotta take that picture sometime myself. You did a good job giving it a surreal look.', '2006-03-30 17:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274029, 310434, 5792, '<td valign="top">Technical perfection. The tones you captured in this image are great and the reds give the composition exceptional elegance.</td>', 'Technical perfection. The tones you captured in this image are great and the reds give the composition exceptional elegance.', '2006-03-30 17:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274030, 308138, 5792, '<td valign="top">Here I am innocently voting along and with each image saying to myself, "I''ll give this one an 8" and "I''ll give this one a 9." and so on. I won''t say what the first thought that popped into my head about what I wanted to give this one. ;) What I will say is that I will give this interesting composition the high score it deserves. The only minor improvement I would suggest is to tone down the bright area on arm on the far left side of the frame.</td>', 'Here I am innocently voting along and with each image saying to myself, "I''ll give this one an 8" and "I''ll give this one a 9." and so on. I won''t say what the first thought that popped into my head about what I wanted to give this one. ;) What I will say is that I will give this interesting composition the high score it deserves. The only minor improvement I would suggest is to tone down the bright area on arm on the far left side of the frame.', '2006-03-30 17:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274031, 310198, 5792, '<td valign="top">The red in the match heads is what sets this composition apart from the other tributes to this image.</td>', 'The red in the match heads is what sets this composition apart from the other tributes to this image.', '2006-03-30 17:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274034, 310249, 5792, '<td valign="top">Yours is a fun parity. Kiwiness has created so many great images that you could not go wrong selecting any one at random to pay tribute. This particular one has always been one of my favorites of his. You have done a fantastic job with it.</td>', 'Yours is a fun parity. Kiwiness has created so many great images that you could not go wrong selecting any one at random to pay tribute. This particular one has always been one of my favorites of his. You have done a fantastic job with it.', '2006-03-30 17:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
