(2276856, 310576, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>...and with your score, you only ended up 29th out of 140.  Sometimes there is no justice.<br/> <br/>Forgive me if I don''t spend too much time attempting to critique your splendid image.  It is just fine; composition works, technicals spot on, lady bug - not red, can''t have everything. Especially if you scooped her off the windowsill.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work and you''ll achieve your goals soon.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  ...and with your score, you only ended up 29th out of 140.  Sometimes there is no justice. Forgive me if I don''t spend too much time attempting to critique your splendid image.  It is just fine; composition works, technicals spot on, lady bug - not red, can''t have everything. Especially if you scooped her off the windowsill. Keep up the good work and you''ll achieve your goals soon. ', '2006-03-31 16:28:06.000000', NULL, 0),
