(2277298, 310249, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dleach:</b></div><hr/><i> Did you do anything special to get the water drops to stay up like the did? I tried this on glass and the water kept spreading out... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t do anything special. Pretty much used Gary''s recipe. A syringe to make the drops on a piece of a blue plastic party bag.</td>', 'Originally posted by dleach: Did you do anything special to get the water drops to stay up like the did? I tried this on glass and the water kept spreading out...   I didn''t do anything special. Pretty much used Gary''s recipe. A syringe to make the drops on a piece of a blue plastic party bag.', '2006-03-31 21:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
