(2277609, 310638, 14386, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much Rikki.  I am very overwhelmed by your "tribute".  I know you could have done better in other genre thus doing this is really a "sacrfce" on your part.<br/> <br/>Now the critique...maybe you can try more sharpening and the diffused glow on her skin.  Aside from that, the pic is okay.  Very beautiful model I must say.  And you give justice to the orig kabayan.</td>', 'Thank you so much Rikki.  I am very overwhelmed by your "tribute".  I know you could have done better in other genre thus doing this is really a "sacrfce" on your part. Now the critique...maybe you can try more sharpening and the diffused glow on her skin.  Aside from that, the pic is okay.  Very beautiful model I must say.  And you give justice to the orig kabayan.', '2006-04-01 00:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
