(2277931, 307903, 44751, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sonifo:</b></div><hr/><i> Yes, Joann, I am very flattered.  Thanks, Manic53.  <br/> <br/>This is a beautiful image.  You should be very proud of your work.  Beautiful!  Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the compliments, Sonifo.  Your photo was a great inspiration and quite a challenge for me, but I loved it so much that I was determined to keep going despite some set backs and some aspects that I had no idea how to tackle.  I learnt a great deal from studying your shot in detail (plus an argument or two with GIS_boy....), but the red makes it all worthwhile.  <br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>N</td>', 'Originally posted by Sonifo: Yes, Joann, I am very flattered.  Thanks, Manic53.   This is a beautiful image.  You should be very proud of your work.  Beautiful!  Congrats!   Thanks for the compliments, Sonifo.  Your photo was a great inspiration and quite a challenge for me, but I loved it so much that I was determined to keep going despite some set backs and some aspects that I had no idea how to tackle.  I learnt a great deal from studying your shot in detail (plus an argument or two with GIS_boy....), but the red makes it all worthwhile.   :) N', '2006-04-01 04:30:22.000000', NULL, 0),
