(2278476, 310595, 6349, '<td valign="top">It was a joke.  I didn''t have the time to actually shoot for the challenge but I wanted to share this photo.  The closest I could find was this one (the only real similarity being a small animal on the head in a zoo setting) plus I thought the title was funny. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=202108" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/356/thumb/202108.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/356/thumb/202108.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/356/thumb/202108.jpg"/></a></td>', 'It was a joke.  I didn''t have the time to actually shoot for the challenge but I wanted to share this photo.  The closest I could find was this one (the only real similarity being a small animal on the head in a zoo setting) plus I thought the title was funny. ', '2006-04-01 14:14:07.000000', NULL, 0),
