(2386424, 309539, 37719, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how I missed coming back to this or even on the many times I have viewed your profile. This got a 10 from me - just perfect!  Very well executed and extremely well exposed - focus, lighting, balance all very well done.  The processing kept everything true.  The colors are beautiful and well preserved.  Very well done!  Congrats on the top 20!</td>', 'I don''t know how I missed coming back to this or even on the many times I have viewed your profile. This got a 10 from me - just perfect!  Very well executed and extremely well exposed - focus, lighting, balance all very well done.  The processing kept everything true.  The colors are beautiful and well preserved.  Very well done!  Congrats on the top 20!', '2006-05-06 00:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
