(2462045, 309800, 34659, '<td valign="top">There aren''t many waterfall shots that work well in B/W.  This one does pretty well though.  Something about the tonal range and/or contrast seems to make it lose a bit of detail in the extreme lighter &amp; darker areas, but overall a very nice job.  Great movement captured.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-27 14:26:26.</i></td>', 'There aren''t many waterfall shots that work well in B/W.  This one does pretty well though.  Something about the tonal range and/or contrast seems to make it lose a bit of detail in the extreme lighter & darker areas, but overall a very nice job.  Great movement captured.', '2006-05-27 15:24:43.000000', '2006-05-27 15:26:26.000000', 0),
