(2757273, 310063, 23913, '<td valign="top">This is (and i mean nothing aginst the origional) way better than the origional.<br/> <br/>the lighting is more refined with in the technique used in both shots. the sharpness plays better acrossed this than the former...and the face is truly more expressive (when compaired).<br/> <br/>to me this tops the origional shot by far. it brings a real conection to the viewer that the other failed to have at any high level.<br/> <br/>the energy to is different here, and conveys different feeling and emotional value...it is far less cold. and far more touching/caring.<br/> <br/>truly a great image....with alot to say.<br/> <br/>the title suites it as well.</td>', 'This is (and i mean nothing aginst the origional) way better than the origional. the lighting is more refined with in the technique used in both shots. the sharpness plays better acrossed this than the former...and the face is truly more expressive (when compaired). to me this tops the origional shot by far. it brings a real conection to the viewer that the other failed to have at any high level. the energy to is different here, and conveys different feeling and emotional value...it is far less cold. and far more touching/caring. truly a great image....with alot to say. the title suites it as well.', '2006-08-24 16:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
